Keenu is a modified version of Isle by zickrian (https://github.com/zickrian/isle), also published
under GPL-3.0-or-later, and later renamed Neeru. As GPL section 5(a) requires, this states that the work has
been modified. The changes begin at the rename to Keenu, version 2.0.0-alpha.1: see CHANGELOG.md. Files carrying
"Copyright (C) 2026 zickrian" keep that notice. Internal identifiers such as the D-Bus name
io.github.zickrian.isle.* and the GNOME extension id isle@zickrian.github.io are kept for compatibility with
existing installations; they do not mean the original author publishes, endorses or supports Keenu.

Included works, each under its own terms:

- Inter typeface (data/fonts): SIL Open Font License 1.1, see data/fonts/Inter-LICENSE.txt.
- bloub, by Jérémy Perret, the assistant's expressions: MIT, see gnome-extension/NOTICE-bloub.txt.
- Lucide, the calendar icon's shape: ISC, see gnome-extension/NOTICE-lucide.txt.
- Simple Icons (CC0), the Claude and OpenAI logos on the AI usage page. These are trademarks of Anthropic and
  OpenAI, shown only to name their plans.

Lyrics are looked up, when the user turns that on, from LRCLIB (https://lrclib.net). Rust crates are listed in
Cargo.lock; their licences are checked by `cargo deny` against deny.toml.
